{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:05:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_67a94360591641c0a408e029327e2500","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1531260f91c653fa4c15b7c41d95a9ea9c4f142a9fe5e0507c4f2ecc01fb1d5a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"lajosdeme/mole@fcb92379120d snapshot 955c751591a38231","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4265b6a48bb38730f064b7031a582298ad570d9526de2b6abf1fc6eeed4fa3e8"],"source_ids":["src_e0deca96a36857d8bcfcad0322447ca2"],"text":"Claims whose quotes do not appear verbatim in the mined page are discarded at extraction; surviving claims can be re-read against sources and marked unsupported in the report.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:05:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_67a94360591641c0a408e029327e2500"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:05:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_67a94360591641c0a408e029327e2500","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_452ecfe8a0d36f6915ac00b185c19e61165c13ed3084eec5974b604104394ad8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"lajosdeme/mole@fcb92379120d snapshot 955c751591a38231","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a959327b2bf3671537afa26fac274daab2d4ae2bf4ab5df50d24ea30184c1031","slc_dfd9f82f533e86214c1b2fe90a842042da57130b082257b5c7aeac84a292bca4"],"source_ids":["src_e0deca96a36857d8bcfcad0322447ca2"],"text":"The pipeline runs planner, executor, actor (search/fetch/extract/mine), verifier (pairing, adjudication, claim graph, re-read sampling), and output stages, with three actor types: web, academic (Crossref, OpenAlex, arXiv, PubMed), and local_compute.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:05:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_67a94360591641c0a408e029327e2500"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:05:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_67a94360591641c0a408e029327e2500","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7cf3d97f1febdc9766ac5836e7d427d736e2fae0e272230e807300788d0a2b77","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"lajosdeme/mole@fcb92379120d snapshot 955c751591a38231","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8edbfef8412d2e2bb3a7ee83601f522f9fc0a29225b80963973ad98524559bc9","slc_a0bd5cb4c450ca04b011554885100de82277b1ba89e13cab48786cad70634c6f","slc_c00a64b8b429a9ba556f313a2d5f716d6879bc521ff7b84e891e1ea82e841c2d"],"source_ids":["src_e0deca96a36857d8bcfcad0322447ca2"],"text":"Toolkit mode (`mole serve --toolkit`) exposes fourteen `mole.<tool>` tools alongside the research tools, including search/fetch through an SSRF guard, robots handling and rate limiter, plus verify_quote, claim_add, aggregate and dataset tools.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:05:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_67a94360591641c0a408e029327e2500"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:05:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_67a94360591641c0a408e029327e2500","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_84543e5ada30fb8932ed4193251aec378a6f9f4ea09ef3a75d4f7ae6fc67dae7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"lajosdeme/mole@fcb92379120d snapshot 955c751591a38231","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_13849b3ebb5af7a3b5eabe2a826e84b9a0ccb9eab4aba6902c88dd8d1575d9c3","slc_72d0b5fd28b53ceff462d8d99f7afb0c5a79715ff67fa29fd12db098fb38802f"],"source_ids":["src_e0deca96a36857d8bcfcad0322447ca2"],"text":"Mole grades its own runs: `mole eval <session-id>` prints a scorecard, and reported metrics include 0% budget overshoot, 100% claim integrity and citation accuracy, 80% grounding rate, and 70% contradiction precision with the confirm pass.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:05:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_67a94360591641c0a408e029327e2500"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:05:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_67a94360591641c0a408e029327e2500","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8d03659d538be2699885d99bc76202f05203bbe79a349eda801f3ff3d322b443","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"lajosdeme/mole@fcb92379120d snapshot 955c751591a38231","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_916b33948d51ba8d10714655c5e7aeb84eedaf39e015f632854be4a0d158f429","slc_fbe64318ad5a41f5629d052838bddc0c557024236a3c8ac28caad45ca418e244"],"source_ids":["src_e0deca96a36857d8bcfcad0322447ca2"],"text":"Every model call is reserved before it happens and settled after, against a ledger with non-negative constraints in the database schema, so a set budget ceiling is enforced rather than estimated.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:05:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_67a94360591641c0a408e029327e2500"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:05:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_67a94360591641c0a408e029327e2500","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ad2bb538fb90c3bc61469d1b465199b517a3ffcfd2b5fedea4f16525e0783c35","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"lajosdeme/mole@fcb92379120d snapshot 955c751591a38231","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fbe64318ad5a41f5629d052838bddc0c557024236a3c8ac28caad45ca418e244"],"source_ids":["src_e0deca96a36857d8bcfcad0322447ca2"],"text":"Mole is a deep-research agent that decomposes a question, searches, extracts claims, quote-checks each against its source, detects contradictions, and writes a cited answer.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:05:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_67a94360591641c0a408e029327e2500"}
